Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:07.68,0:13:08.28,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}父さんも
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:09.37,0:13:10.61,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}褒めてくれるんだ
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:11.15,0:13:13.44,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}エヴァに乗ると褒めてくれるんだ！
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:13.78,0:13:16.53,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}こんな僕をみんなも 乗れって言ってるんだ
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:16.80,0:13:17.73,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}父さんを…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:18.28,0:13:20.25,JPBody,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2\pos(720,1065)\fsp3}僕を捨てた父さんを 見返してやるんだ
